    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Make a ranged touch attack with the orb. A creature struck takes 4d8 fel damage. On impact, every other creature within 5 feet takes 1d8 fel damage, with a Reflex save for half.</p><p>Instead of targeting a creature, you may target a grid intersection as with a splash weapon. If an attack against a creature misses, determine the landing intersection using the normal missed splash-weapon rules; the explosion occurs there.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Resolve the touch attack, missed-splash scatter, impact point, and secondary Reflex saves manually.</p>"
    },
